{"id":1061303,"name":"霁川·审查Ⅲ","type":"trial","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"霁川·审查Ⅲ","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1061303]}],"trial":{"trial_id":61303,"stage":"阶段3","unlock_time":"2026-05-07 14:00:00","diary1":"风雪、严寒、奔逃的人群。一切如此真实，裹挟着你在这冰天雪地中一次次迷失方位。这就是她在最后的生命里，仍然牵挂的东西。连你都在这里迷失了，又何况是身处其中的霁川。\n　　污染重新蚕食着她，打破她美好的幻想，一次次诘问她：此生，何以至此。","diary2":"那些在意识边缘闪回的画面，何尝不是她未竟理想的残影。你与她立下约定：将这破碎的一切，在现实里重新续写。\n　　象征她意志的梅枝已在这片精神荒原中扎根生长，不再屈从于风雪。接下来的战斗，便是这具病躯与时间的较量。\n　　返回狄斯的途中，霁川身上已经插满了仪器管线，但她面容平和，唇角带着很淡的弧度。那是将一切托付于你的平静。","evidence":[{"ID":260901,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260902,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161303001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161303002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161303003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161303004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161303005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161303006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161303007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161303008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161303009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161303010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161303011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161303012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161303013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161303014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161303015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161303016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161303017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161303018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161303019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161303020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161303021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161303022,"next":null},{"step":23,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161303023